# (AI-assisted) save then load: tasks 2..30 closed and 42 cells, an autosave (slot 0) in
# village2; then tasks 60..69 closed elsewhere; restore slot 0 (auto-save-command 'restore):
# Jak is back at village2-start, task 4 closed (0) and task 62 open again (2).
#   OPENGOAL_NO_SOUND=1 OPENGOAL_PAD_SCRIPT=<this file> build-host-small/game/gk --proj-path <proj>
#     --config-path <scratch dir> --ctr-gfx -- -boot -fakeiso -nosound -cbackend
# (host small-memory C-mode gk running the p3ds modules; --config-path keeps the saves out of
# the user's OpenGOAL folder). Format and commands: game/sce/pad_script.h
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
200 continue village2-start
201 wait *target* target-continue
440 tasks 2 30
450 call poke32 $*game-info* 92 f42
460 save
900 log SAVED
901 call get-task-status 4
902 call get-task-status 62
1000 continue snow-start
1001 wait *target* target-continue
1240 tasks 60 69
1250 call poke32 $*game-info* 92 f1
1260 call get-task-status 62
1300 call auto-save-command 'restore 0 0 $*default-pool*
1310 log RESTORE
1600 pos *target*
1900 pos *target*
2200 pos *target*
2201 call get-task-status 4
2202 call get-task-status 62
2203 print *game-info*
2210 progress 0
2400 shot
2500 log DONE
2501 exit
